# DTL Reader

Syntax highlighting support for DTL visual novel scripts.

How to use?

    1) Add the DTL reader package. It will provide partial identification of DTL file.
    2) Use DTL theme as it will provide full support over DTL files.



Important philosophy that can differ from using Dialogic on Godot:

- This highlight chose to not consider to color '' as string as I simply use it for the english apostrophes. It would render the code impossible to read if it was done.
- labels MUST not be setup with spaces or any kind of brakets.